{% comment %}
    LIFE GROUP SEARCH — the group finder (route `next-steps/find-a-group/search`,
    InnerDefault). Its start page is /next-steps/find-a-group (FindGroup.lava);
    each card opens the group's page (LifeGroupDetails.lava).

    Block:                    an HTML block in the Main zone
    Block content:            {% include '~~/Assets/Lava/LifeGroupSearch.lava' %}
    Enabled Lava Commands:    RockEntity  (the groups, the campuses)

    Built instead of Rock's Group Finder block (Rock 18.8): that block posts
    the page back for every search and reads nothing from the address, so a
    quiz can't hand it answers. There are about 50 public Life Groups, so this
    renders them all as cards and the browser filters them instantly
    (theme.js "Group finder"; Styles/_group-finder.scss). Without JavaScript
    every group simply shows.

    HOW IT WORKS
      A short quiz, one question per screen, each answer showing how many
      groups it leaves (answers that would leave none are disabled, so there's
      always a group to show). "Skip to all groups" is always there. The
      answers go in the address, so results can be shared, and a link that
      already carries answers (the Life Groups page's buttons, the start page's
      drop-in tile) skips the quiz. ?all shows every group.

      On the results, a filter bar stays under the header as you scroll: one
      button per question showing its answer. A button opens that question's
      answers in a panel that grows the bar (it pushes the cards down rather
      than covering them, phones included); changes apply at once. Clear all
      keeps the results with no filters; Start over reopens the quiz.

      Question                      Card data (from Rock)            Address
      What kind of group?           GroupComp (Mixed, Men, Women,     who=men
                                    Young Adult; multi-select)
      Which days work?              DaysOfWeek (multi-select; the     days=monday,tuesday
                                    schedule's text if it's empty)
      Follow the weekend message?   Topic is "Sermon Series" or not   content=sermon | other
      Need childcare?               HasChildcare Yes or Ask for       childcare=yes
                                    Details (an "it depends" counts)
      Meet at VRL?                  the group's location is the       where=campus | offsite
                                    Barker campus (the campus's
                                    location or a room in it, or an
                                    address of 1831 S Barker)
      (off campus) Where?           the location's city               area=liberty-lake
      (not asked; from links)       IsDropInGroup                     dropin=yes

      If an address's answers match no group, the finder leaves answers out,
      least important first (area, days, content, place, childcare, drop in,
      who), until groups show, and says which it left out.

    CARDS: a band across the top with the day(s) and the kind of group, in
    that kind's colour (colorByGroupType below; Styles/_group-finder.scss
    "Group colours": mixed green, men blue, women rose, young adults violet;
    a group that's both takes the more specific: young adults, then men or
    women). A drop-in group gets a "Drop in" sticker; childcare (Yes, or Ask
    for Details: "?") is an icon at the bottom right.

    A card opens the group's page (LifeGroupDetails.lava) in a pop-up over the
    results (theme.js "Group pop-up"; the address gets ?group=ID so it can be
    shared). If the group's AlternateSignup attribute holds an address, the
    card goes straight there instead ("Sign up"; a new tab when it's off-site).

    PRIVACY: a home group shows its town, never its street. Coordinates (for
    "Closest to me") are rounded to two decimals, about 1 km, for EVERY group,
    so no home address can be read from the page. The visitor's own location
    stays in their browser.

    SETTINGS below: the group type, whether full groups show (marked "Full"),
    the group page's address, colours by kind of group.
{% endcomment %}

{%- comment -%} ===== SETTINGS ===== {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign groupTypeId = 25 -%}
{%- assign showFullGroups = false -%}{%- comment -%} true: full groups show, marked Full {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign groupDetailUrl = '/next-steps/find-a-group/details' -%}
{%- assign colorByGroupType = true -%}{%- comment -%} false: every band is neutral grey (keep LifeGroupDetails.lava's the same) {%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign dayNames = 'sunday,monday,tuesday,wednesday,thursday,friday,saturday' | Split:',' -%}
{%- assign clockIcon = '<svg width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-clock"/></svg>' -%}
{%- assign pinIcon = '<svg width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-map-pin"/></svg>' -%}
{%- assign childcareIcon = '<svg width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-kid"/></svg>' -%}
{%- assign compLabels = 'mixed:Mixed|men:Men’s|women:Women’s|young-adult:Young adults' | Split:'|' -%}

{%- comment -%} Campus locations: a group there (or in a room inside one) meets at VRL {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign campusLocationIds = ',' -%}
{%- campus where:'IsActive == true' securityenabled:'false' -%}
  {%- for campusItem in campusItems -%}
    {%- if campusItem.LocationId %}{% assign campusLocationIds = campusLocationIds | Append:campusItem.LocationId | Append:',' %}{% endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endcampus -%}

{%- assign cardsHtml = '' -%}
{%- assign cardCount = 0 -%}
{%- group where:'GroupTypeId == {{ groupTypeId }} && IsActive == true && IsPublic == true && IsArchived == false' sort:'Name' limit:'500' securityenabled:'false' -%}
{%- for group in groupItems -%}

  {%- comment -%} Full: capacity set and reached {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign isFull = false -%}
  {%- assign capacity = group.GroupCapacity | Default:0 | AsInteger -%}
  {%- if capacity > 0 -%}
    {%- assign activeMembers = 0 -%}
    {%- for member in group.Members -%}
      {%- capture memberStatus %}{{ member.GroupMemberStatus }}{% endcapture -%}
      {%- if memberStatus == 'Active' %}{% assign activeMembers = activeMembers | Plus:1 %}{% endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
    {%- if activeMembers >= capacity %}{% assign isFull = true %}{% endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if isFull and showFullGroups == false %}{% continue %}{% endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} Who: GroupComp's values as keys (mixed, men, women, young-adult) {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign compText = group | Attribute:'GroupComp' | Trim -%}
  {%- assign compList = compText | Split:',' -%}
  {%- assign compKeys = '' -%}
  {%- assign kindText = '' -%}
  {%- for compItem in compList -%}
    {%- assign compName = compItem | Trim -%}
    {%- if compName != '' -%}
      {%- assign compKey = compName | Downcase | Replace:' ','-' -%}
      {%- assign compKeys = compKeys | Append:' ' | Append:compKey -%}
      {%- assign compLabel = compName -%}
      {%- for pair in compLabels -%}
        {%- assign pairKey = pair | Split:':' | First -%}
        {%- if pairKey == compKey %}{% assign compLabel = pair | Split:':' | Last %}{% endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
      {%- if kindText != '' %}{% assign kindText = kindText | Append:' · ' %}{% endif -%}
      {%- assign kindText = kindText | Append:compLabel -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- comment -%} Colour: the most specific kind (young adults, then men or women, then mixed) {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign compPadded = compKeys | Append:' ' -%}
  {%- assign toneKey = '' -%}
  {%- if compPadded contains ' young-adult ' %}{% assign toneKey = 'young-adult' %}{% elsif compPadded contains ' men ' %}{% assign toneKey = 'men' %}{% elsif compPadded contains ' women ' %}{% assign toneKey = 'women' %}{% elsif compPadded contains ' mixed ' %}{% assign toneKey = 'mixed' %}{% endif -%}
  {%- if colorByGroupType == false %}{% assign toneKey = '' %}{% endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} Sign up somewhere else: AlternateSignup (an address) replaces the group page {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign altSignup = group | Attribute:'AlternateSignup','RawValue' | Trim -%}
  {%- assign altExternal = false -%}
  {%- if altSignup != '' -%}
    {%- assign altStart = altSignup | Slice:0,4 | Downcase -%}
    {%- if altStart == 'http' %}{% unless altSignup contains 'vrl.church' %}{% assign altExternal = true %}{% endunless %}{% endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} Days: DaysOfWeek, or the schedule's text when it's empty {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign schedText = group.Schedule.FriendlyScheduleText | Default:'' | Trim -%}
  {%- assign daysText = group | Attribute:'DaysOfWeek' | Downcase -%}
  {%- if daysText == '' %}{% assign daysText = schedText | Downcase %}{% endif -%}
  {%- assign dayKeys = '' -%}
  {%- assign dayShort = '' -%}
  {%- for dayName in dayNames -%}
    {%- if daysText contains dayName -%}
      {%- assign dayKeys = dayKeys | Append:' ' | Append:dayName -%}
      {%- assign dayAbbr = dayName | Slice:0,3 | Capitalize -%}
      {%- if dayShort != '' %}{% assign dayShort = dayShort | Append:' · ' %}{% endif -%}
      {%- assign dayShort = dayShort | Append:dayAbbr -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- comment -%} The schedule line: "Mondays at 6:30 PM" ("Weekly: " dropped); a multi-date list reads as "See the group for times" {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if schedText contains '<' %}{% assign schedText = 'See the group for times' %}{% endif -%}
  {%- assign schedText = schedText | Replace:'Weekly: ','' -%}
  {%- capture startTime %}{{ group.Schedule.StartTimeOfDay }}{% endcapture -%}
  {%- assign startTime = startTime | Trim | Slice:0,5 -%}

  {%- comment -%} Content, childcare, drop in {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign topicText = group | Attribute:'Topic' | Downcase -%}
  {%- assign contentKey = 'other' -%}
  {%- if topicText contains 'sermon series' %}{% assign contentKey = 'sermon' %}{% endif -%}
  {%- assign childcareText = group | Attribute:'HasChildcare' | Downcase | Trim -%}
  {%- assign childcareKey = '' -%}
  {%- assign childcareLabel = '' -%}
  {%- if childcareText == 'yes' -%}
    {%- assign childcareKey = 'yes' -%}{%- assign childcareLabel = 'Childcare available' -%}
  {%- elsif childcareText contains 'ask' -%}
    {%- assign childcareKey = 'yes' -%}{%- assign childcareLabel = 'Ask about childcare' -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- assign dropInText = group | Attribute:'IsDropInGroup' | Downcase | Trim -%}
  {%- assign dropInKey = '' -%}
  {%- if dropInText == 'yes' or dropInText == 'true' %}{% assign dropInKey = 'yes' %}{% endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} Place: at VRL, or the town; coordinates rounded (about 1 km) {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign groupLocation = null -%}
  {%- for gl in group.GroupLocations -%}
    {%- if gl.Location %}{% assign groupLocation = gl.Location %}{% break %}{% endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- assign onCampus = false -%}
  {%- assign areaName = '' -%}
  {%- assign areaKey = '' -%}
  {%- assign lat = '' -%}
  {%- assign lng = '' -%}
  {%- if groupLocation -%}
    {%- assign street = groupLocation.Street1 | Default:'' | Downcase -%}
    {%- assign locationName = groupLocation.Name | Default:'' | Downcase -%}
    {%- assign locationKey = ',' | Append:groupLocation.Id | Append:',' -%}
    {%- assign parentKey = ',' | Append:groupLocation.ParentLocationId | Append:',' -%}
    {%- if street contains '1831' and street contains 'barker' %}{% assign onCampus = true %}{% endif -%}
    {%- if locationName contains 'barker' %}{% assign onCampus = true %}{% endif -%}
    {%- if campusLocationIds contains locationKey or campusLocationIds contains parentKey %}{% assign onCampus = true %}{% endif -%}
    {%- if onCampus == false -%}
      {%- assign areaName = groupLocation.City | Default:'' | Trim -%}
      {%- assign areaKey = areaName | Downcase | Replace:' ','-' -%}
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if groupLocation.Latitude -%}
      {%- assign lat = groupLocation.Latitude | Format:'0.00' -%}
      {%- assign lng = groupLocation.Longitude | Format:'0.00' -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- capture card -%}
  <li class="group-card{% if dropInKey == 'yes' %} group-card--dropin{% endif %}"{% if toneKey != '' %} data-tone="{{ toneKey }}"{% endif %} data-card data-who="{{ compKeys | Trim }}" data-days="{{ dayKeys | Trim }}" data-content="{{ contentKey }}" data-childcare="{{ childcareKey }}" data-dropin="{{ dropInKey }}" data-where="{% if onCampus %}campus{% else %}offsite{% endif %}" data-area="{{ areaKey }}" data-area-name="{{ areaName | Escape }}" data-time="{{ startTime }}"{% if lat != '' %} data-lat="{{ lat }}" data-lng="{{ lng }}"{% endif %}>
    {%- if dropInKey == 'yes' %}
    <span class="group-card__sticker">Drop in</span>
    {%- endif %}
    <div class="group-card__band">
      <p class="group-card__when">{% if dayShort != '' %}{{ dayShort }}{% else %}Day varies{% endif %}</p>
      {%- if kindText != '' %}
      <p class="group-card__kind">{{ kindText }}</p>
      {%- endif %}
    </div>
    {%- if altSignup != '' %}
    <h3 class="group-card__title"><a href="{{ altSignup | Escape }}"{% if altExternal %} target="_blank" rel="noopener"{% endif %} data-card-link>{{ group.Name }}</a></h3>
    {%- else %}
    <h3 class="group-card__title"><a href="{{ groupDetailUrl }}?GroupId={{ group.Id }}" data-card-link data-group-modal="{{ group.Id }}">{{ group.Name }}</a></h3>
    {%- endif %}
    <ul class="group-card__tags">
      {%- if contentKey == 'sermon' %}<li>Follows the message</li>{% endif -%}
      {%- if isFull %}<li class="group-card__full">Full</li>{% endif -%}
    </ul>
    {%- assign description = group.Description | StripHtml | Trim -%}
    {%- if description != '' %}
    <p class="group-card__desc">{{ description | TruncateWords:32 }}</p>
    {%- endif %}
    <ul class="group-card__meta">
      {%- if schedText != '' %}
      <li>{{ clockIcon }} {{ schedText }}</li>
      {%- endif %}
      <li>{{ pinIcon }} {% if onCampus %}At VRL{% elsif areaName != '' %}{{ areaName }}{% else %}Ask for the location{% endif %}<span class="group-card__distance" data-gf-distance></span></li>
    </ul>
    <div class="group-card__foot">
      {%- if altSignup != '' %}
      <span class="group-card__cta" aria-hidden="true">Sign up <svg width="14" height="14"><use href="#i-arrow-up-right"/></svg></span>
      {%- else %}
      <span class="group-card__cta" aria-hidden="true">View group <svg width="14" height="14"><use href="#i-arrow-right"/></svg></span>
      {%- endif %}
      {%- if childcareLabel != '' %}
      <span class="group-card__childcare{% if childcareText contains 'ask' %} group-card__childcare--ask{% endif %}" title="{{ childcareLabel }}">{{ childcareIcon }}<span class="u-visually-hidden">{{ childcareLabel }}</span></span>
      {%- endif %}
    </div>
  </li>
  {%- endcapture -%}
  {%- assign cardsHtml = cardsHtml | Append:card -%}
  {%- assign cardCount = cardCount | Plus:1 -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- endgroup -%}

<section class="gf" aria-label="Find a Life Group" data-group-finder>

  {%- if cardCount > 0 %}
  <!-- ===== QUIZ (shown by theme.js; without JavaScript every group shows) ===== -->
  <div class="gf-quiz" data-gf-quiz hidden>
    <div class="gf-quiz__head">
      <p class="gf-quiz__progress" data-gf-progress>Question 1</p>
      <button type="button" class="gf-quiz__skip" data-gf-skip>Skip to all groups</button>
    </div>
    <div class="gf-quiz__bar" aria-hidden="true"><span data-gf-bar></span></div>

    <div class="gf-step" data-gf-step="who" hidden>
      <p class="gf-step__intro">Answer a few quick questions and we'll show you the groups that fit.</p>
      <h2 class="gf-step__q" tabindex="-1">What kind of group are you looking for?</h2>
      <div class="gf-options">
        <button type="button" class="gf-option" data-value="men"{% if colorByGroupType %} data-tone="men"{% endif %}>Men's group<span class="gf-option__count" data-gf-count></span></button>
        <button type="button" class="gf-option" data-value="women"{% if colorByGroupType %} data-tone="women"{% endif %}>Women's group<span class="gf-option__count" data-gf-count></span></button>
        <button type="button" class="gf-option" data-value="mixed"{% if colorByGroupType %} data-tone="mixed"{% endif %}>Mixed (men and women)<span class="gf-option__count" data-gf-count></span></button>
        <button type="button" class="gf-option" data-value="young-adult"{% if colorByGroupType %} data-tone="young-adult"{% endif %}>Young adults<span class="gf-option__count" data-gf-count></span></button>
        <button type="button" class="gf-option gf-option--any" data-value="" data-gf-filter-only>Any<span class="gf-option__count" data-gf-count></span></button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gf-step" data-gf-step="days" data-gf-multi hidden>
      <h2 class="gf-step__q" tabindex="-1">Which days work for you?</h2>
      <p class="gf-step__hint">Pick as many as you like.</p>
      <div class="gf-options gf-options--days">
        <button type="button" class="gf-option" data-value="sunday">Sunday<span class="gf-option__count" data-gf-count></span></button>
        <button type="button" class="gf-option" data-value="monday">Monday<span class="gf-option__count" data-gf-count></span></button>
        <button type="button" class="gf-option" data-value="tuesday">Tuesday<span class="gf-option__count" data-gf-count></span></button>
        <button type="button" class="gf-option" data-value="wednesday">Wednesday<span class="gf-option__count" data-gf-count></span></button>
        <button type="button" class="gf-option" data-value="thursday">Thursday<span class="gf-option__count" data-gf-count></span></button>
        <button type="button" class="gf-option" data-value="friday">Friday<span class="gf-option__count" data-gf-count></span></button>
        <button type="button" class="gf-option" data-value="saturday">Saturday<span class="gf-option__count" data-gf-count></span></button>
        <button type="button" class="gf-option gf-option--any" data-value="">Any day<span class="gf-option__count" data-gf-count></span></button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gf-step" data-gf-step="content" hidden>
      <h2 class="gf-step__q" tabindex="-1">Do you want to follow along with the weekend message?</h2>
      <p class="gf-step__hint">Many groups talk through Sunday's message each week. Others study a book or topic.</p>
      <div class="gf-options">
        <button type="button" class="gf-option" data-value="sermon">Yes, follow the message<span class="gf-option__count" data-gf-count></span></button>
        <button type="button" class="gf-option" data-value="other">Something else<span class="gf-option__count" data-gf-count></span></button>
        <button type="button" class="gf-option gf-option--any" data-value="">Any<span class="gf-option__count" data-gf-count></span></button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gf-step" data-gf-step="childcare" hidden>
      <h2 class="gf-step__q" tabindex="-1">Do you need childcare while the group meets?</h2>
      <div class="gf-options">
        <button type="button" class="gf-option" data-value="yes">Yes, I need childcare<span class="gf-option__count" data-gf-count></span></button>
        <button type="button" class="gf-option gf-option--any" data-value="" data-gf-filter-label="Any">No<span class="gf-option__count" data-gf-count></span></button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gf-step" data-gf-step="where" hidden>
      <h2 class="gf-step__q" tabindex="-1">Do you want a group that meets at VRL?</h2>
      <div class="gf-options">
        <button type="button" class="gf-option" data-value="campus">Yes, at VRL<span class="gf-option__count" data-gf-count></span></button>
        <button type="button" class="gf-option" data-value="offsite">No, in a home or around town<span class="gf-option__count" data-gf-count></span></button>
        <button type="button" class="gf-option gf-option--any" data-value="">Any<span class="gf-option__count" data-gf-count></span></button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gf-step" data-gf-step="area" data-gf-multi hidden>
      <h2 class="gf-step__q" tabindex="-1">Where would you like to meet?</h2>
      <p class="gf-step__hint">Pick any areas that work, or let us sort by what's closest to you.</p>
      <div class="gf-options gf-options--areas" data-gf-areas>
        <button type="button" class="gf-option gf-option--any" data-value="">Anywhere<span class="gf-option__count" data-gf-count></span></button>
      </div>
      <p class="gf-step__near"><button type="button" class="pill-btn" data-gf-near><svg width="14" height="14" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-map-pin"/></svg> Closest to me</button></p>
    </div>

    <div class="gf-quiz__foot">
      <button type="button" class="gf-quiz__back" data-gf-back><svg width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-chevron-left"/></svg> Back</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary" data-gf-next hidden>Next</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ===== RESULTS ===== -->
  <div class="gf-results" data-gf-results>
    <div class="gf-results__head" data-gf-results-head hidden>
      <p class="gf-results__count" data-gf-total aria-live="polite"></p>
      <div class="gf-results__actions">
        <div class="gf-results__sort" role="group" aria-label="Sort groups">
          <button type="button" class="pill-btn" data-gf-sort="soon" aria-pressed="true">Soonest</button>
          <button type="button" class="pill-btn" data-gf-sort="near" aria-pressed="false">Closest to me</button>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="gf-results__restart" data-gf-restart><svg width="14" height="14" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-refresh"/></svg> Start over</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Filter bar: buttons and panels built by theme.js from the quiz's questions -->
    <div class="gf-filters" data-gf-filters hidden>
      <div class="gf-filters__inner">
        <div class="gf-filters__row" role="group" aria-label="Filter groups">
          <span class="gf-filters__label"><svg width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-adjustments"/></svg><span>Filter</span></span>
          <div class="gf-filters__buttons" data-gf-filter-buttons></div>
          <button type="button" class="gf-filters__clear" data-gf-clear hidden>Clear all</button>
        </div>
        <div class="gf-filters__panel" id="gf-filter-panel" data-gf-panel hidden></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="gf-results__note" data-gf-note hidden></p>
    <ul class="gf-cards" data-gf-list>
      {{ cardsHtml }}
    </ul>
  </div>
  {%- else %}
  <p class="gf-empty">Our group listings are being updated. Check back soon, or <a href="/ministries/life-groups">read about Life Groups</a>.</p>
  {%- endif %}

</section>
